🅱️ METHOD 2: Proper Way (Git CLI) — Recommended ⭐
Ye professional tarika hai. Interviewer ko bhi accha lagta hai.

Step 1: Apne Project Folder me Jao
Terminal / PowerShell / Git Bash kholo aur apne project folder me jao:

bash
cd path/to/your/AI-Enterprise-Digital-Twin-Decision-Agent
Example (Windows):

bash
cd C:\Users\YourName\Desktop\AI-Enterprise-Digital-Twin-Decision-Agent
Example (Mac/Linux):

bash
cd ~/Desktop/AI-Enterprise-Digital-Twin-Decision-Agent
Step 2: .gitignore File Banao (MOST IMPORTANT!)
Ye step skip mat karna — warna node_modules, venv, .env sab upload ho jayega aur repo 1GB ka ho jayega.

Project root me .gitignore naam ki file banao aur ye paste karo:

gitignore
