*.swo
*~

# ============ OS ============
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ============ LOGS ============
*.log
logs/

# ============ DATA / OUTPUT ============
data/output/
data/temp/
Step 3: .env.example File Banao (Secrets ka template)
Ye file upload hogi (real .env nahi). Isme dummy values daalo:

env
