Step 5: Git Initialize Karo
Project root me terminal me ye commands ek-ek karke chalao:

bash
# Git initialize karo
git init

# Branch name 'main' set karo
git branch -M main

# Saari files add karo (gitignore respect karega)
git add .

# Check karo kya-kya add hua (optional but recommended)
git status
⚠️ Important: git status chalao aur verify karo ki node_modules, venv, .env nahi dikh rahe. Agar dikh rahe hain toh .gitignore galat hai.

Step 6: First Commit
bash
git commit -m "Initial commit: project structure, backend, frontend, database schema"
Step 7: Remote Origin Add Karo
bash
git remote add origin https://github.com/vishakha2121/AI-Enterprise-Digital-Twin-Decision-Agent.git
Verify karo:

bash
git remote -v
Output aisa aana chahiye:

text
origin  https://github.com/vishakha2121/AI-Enterprise-Digital-Twin-Decision-Agent.git (fetch)
origin  https://github.com/vishakha2121/AI-Enterprise-Digital-Twin-Decision-Agent.git (push)
Step 8: Push Karo GitHub pe 🚀
bash
git push -u origin main
Agar pehli baar push kar rahe ho, toh GitHub username + password (ya Personal Access Token) maangega.

⚠️ Password Issue Aayega!
GitHub ab password accept nahi karta. Personal Access Token (PAT) banana padega:

GitHub → Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens → Tokens (classic)

Generate new token (classic)

Name: my-laptop

Expiration: 90 days

Scopes: ✅ repo (full control)

Generate token → Token copy karo (ek hi baar dikhta hai!)

Push karte waqt:

Username: vishakha2121

Password: wahi token paste karo (GitHub password nahi)

Step 9: Verify Karo
Browser me jao → https://github.com/vishakha2121/AI-Enterprise-Digital-Twin-Decision-Agent

Saari files dikhni chahiye ✅

